window.products.push({"id":313177,"name":"Jet Beautiful Lapis Lazuli Hexagon Shaped Pendulum Energized","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gliULzcYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Lapis Lazuli Hexagon Shaped Pendulum. Kindly note that since all our products are handcrafted and carved there always exist slight deviation in size, shape, color, looks compared to the image shown here Generally, a pendulum cord can be set by holding the cord short and slowly slipping it through the fingers whilst asking for the optimum length. At the point where the cord length is the best for you, the pendulum will move and this is the point to mark, tie a knot or slide the plastic adjuster to that point. Lapis Lazuli encourages taking charge of life. It reveals inner truth, encourages self-awareness, and allows self-expression without holding back or compromising. If repressed anger is causing difficulties in the throat or in communication, Lapis Lazuli releases these. This stone brings the endearing qualities of honesty, compassion and uprightness to the personality. Hypnotherapists also use such pendulums for Healing & Dowsing Patients and treating them for various disorders like Lack of Concentration, Stress, Anxiety, Pain Relief, Sleep Disorders, Weight Loss, Depression, Bed Wetting, Migraines, Stammering, Trauma, Victim Recovery, There are many different methods to find out if a pendulum will work for you or not. One of the most basic and reliable methods of testing is to ask the pendulum directly through a series of specific questions! Pendulums have been used for centuries to find things - water, gold, oil - treasures of all kinds including answers! Through the ages, people have used the pendulum to guide them toward correct answers to their important questions. This pendulum operates as a receiver when asking questions like \"is this the right remedy for me?\", and it also functions as a strong emitter of force when used as a healing device, for example in color therapy. You can do this simple chakra balancing treatment on yourself or on someone else. If you know that a particular chakra needs balancing, it is not essential to use seven stones. Simply place your chosen stone on the chakra that is out of alignment. Energy dowsing can take the form of colour therapy and chakra balancing with a view to healing on various levels. The reactions of the pendulum will vary depending on the length at which the cord is held. If the cord is long then the pendulum will take more time to react. If the cord is held shorter or close to the pendulum then it will react very quickly. The length of the cord will depend on the task.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gliULzcYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jet International Crystal","source_asin":"B019Y9MTT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019Y9MTT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019Y9MTT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
