window.products.push({"id":313207,"name":"Tovolo Waffle Tongs, Mini Silicone Easy-Grip, Non-Slip Handle, Candy Apple Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yGRRP28oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easily lift and grab waffles of all sizes from your waffle maker with the Easy-Grip Silicone Mini Waffle Tongs from Tovolo. Unique hooked end grabs the waffle between the squares to prevent slipping or dropping from waffle maker to plate. The beveled edge slides easily under waffles, releasing the cooked edge from the iron. Strips of non-slip silicone provide grip. Soft-touch silicone feels comfortable in hand, and prevents accidental slips while pulling breakfast off of the waffle maker. The soft-touch silicone will not scratch waffle irons. Keep the tongs closed with the handy locking mechanism. Pull the ring to lock the tongs in the closed position, and push it in to release the arms. Locking mechanism ensure that tongs fit neatly in drawers. Unique shape makes these tongs great for serving, whether in the kitchen or at the buffet. These tongs may be mini, but they provide the grip, strength, and versatility of a full-size set. Their small size uniquely suits them for small hands, so kids can help with breakfast. 8.5\" overall length. BPA-free silicone tips are scratch-resistant, stain-resistant, and food-safe to create the best possible kitchen tool. Silicone is heat resistant up to 600 degrees Fahrenheit, so it can withstand the heat of the waffle iron. Made of stainless steel and BPA-free silicone. Dishwasher safe for easy clean up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yGRRP28oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B084DPQGK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084DPQGK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084DPQGK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
