window.products.push({"id":313384,"name":"Maars Rollie Travel Tumbler Cup for Coffee and Tea, 12 oz | Double Wall Vacuum Insulated - Matcha Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PmtbcgzbL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"The Maars rollie travel tumbler is the ideal cup for drinking when on-the-go. Our insulated tumbler offers great features that makes this the ultimate drinkware. Copper lined insulation The extra copper lining between the double walls allows for even better heat retention that keeps hot beverages heated for over 3 hours while keeping cold drinks refreshingly chilled for over 9 hours. Ideal for a wide range of drinks such as hot Coffee and tea. Double walled stainless steel construction made from the highest quality, food grade 18/8 stainless steel that will not produce any funky flavors or tastes. The double walled Vacuum construction also eliminates any condensation for a sweat proof exterior and is top rack dishwasher safe for easy clean up. Never worry about your cup rusting or leaving a bad metal aftertaste in your drink. Durable powder coated finish We offer 12 beautiful and vibrant powder coated finishes that resists any fading, chipping, peeling, or cracking. Available in: white, Matte black, Coral, Carnation, Lavender, aqua, mint, seafoam, match, Peach, midnight, and silver. Great on the go comes with rubber gasket Sip lid that allows you to take your cup on the go with reduced splashing. Great for different occasions Whether you are commuting to work or winding down on your front porch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PmtbcgzbL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maars Drinkware","source_asin":"B08FFPKMSQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FFPKMSQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FFPKMSQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
