window.products.push({"id":313416,"name":"MEMX Bath, Shower, Tub Mat, 40x16, Machine Washable, BPA Free, Phthalate Free, Latex, Bathtub Mats with Drain Holes, Suction Cups, Non-Slip Bathroom M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RHypLPrrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MEMX Extra Long Non Slip Bhtub Mats Bath Mat is The Best Choice for Bathroom! Basic functions are necessary, such as, non slip, in addition, the extra long bathtub mat can also be a fashion and convenient massage shower mat for kids, elderly, all person you beloved in private bathing space.That's why it was designed with 200 suction cups by our designer who intend not only to provide enough safety for non slippery, but also to increase comfort to the bathtub mat. WHY CHOOSE US: 1. Non-slip Bath Mat: 200 suction cups for firm stay in place and reliable non-slip performance. 2. Highest Quality Materials: BPA Free,Latex Free,Phthalate free.3. Easy to Clean: Machine washable mat bath! 4. Generous Size Bathmat: The XL size bathtub mat is 40 x 16 inch in diameter for maximum coverage on bottom of tub.5. Comfort Massage Mat: The domed designs are like pebbles, which provide massage experience in shower time.6. Versatile Bath Tub Mat: Our floor mat is versatile for home bathroom and it’s a perfect addition for hotels, gyms, saunas, spas. Not only the bath mat can be placed inside the bathtub but also outside the tub. Kindly Reminder: 1. Place Secure suction cups before each use: Press down to make the cups grip surface and hold. Ensure mat is securely in place. Shower Mat will only attach to clean, smooth surface. Avoid using on textured, tiled, non-smooth and refinished surfaces. Do not use bath oils and jump on the bath tub mat to avoid slipping.2. Receive the mat, spread out the mat and place it in a ventilated place for 1-2 days.3. It is recommended soaking the mat in a tub by warm water for 10 minutes prior to your first use to make the bath mat unfold..4. We recommend rinsing and drying your bath mat periodically. The bath mat should be hung up over the tub or somewhere else after use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RHypLPrrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEMX","source_asin":"B08276W8QB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08276W8QB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08276W8QB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
