window.products.push({"id":313432,"name":"Jallen Gabor Robotic Vacuums,Strong Suction, Quiet, Super-Thin Smart Robotic Vacuum Cleaner, Used to Clean Pet Hair, Hard Floors (25x7, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cGtTs+MKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Jallon Gabor Desscription: Intelligent sweeping robot, one button to operate, automatic steering in case of obstacles. Used to sweep garbage such as ash, melon seeds, sand and hair, applicable for marble, tile, wooden floor, etc.. Item Name: Smart Sweeper Notes: Whether it is a carpet or a tile, it must be flat. If it is not flat, when the casters of the vacuum cleaner are higher than the uneven place, the casters will float in the air and rotate, so they will not move forward. Therefore, the casters of the vacuum cleaner must be in contact with the ground. The rotation of the casters can move forward under the action of the running force, If the casters are not in contact with the ground, the casters will float and rotate in the air, so the casters will not move forward, so the carpet and tiles must be flat. Detecting and removing the dust detection sensor will warn the robot to pay attention to dirty places in the home (such as heavy traffic) and clean it thoroughly. The robot vacuum cleaner will not be able to absorb tightly attached garbage and will rotate for a long time until the robot vacuum cleaner thinks it is clean and free of dust. It will continue to work. Sometimes, when the robot detects that the garbage is in close contact with the ground, the robot vacuum cleaner will not be able to absorb the tightly attached garbage. Yes, the trash must be pulled out by hand. (This robot vacuum cleaner is not suitable for vacuuming on carpets only works on short pile carpet ) Battery Capacity: 3.7v/1200mah Charging Time: 3h Use Time: 1h Working Noise: 55db Charging Method: Usb Colour:Blue or Black Material:Abs Size:25x25x7cm Package Contents: 1 Sweeping Robot 2 Side Brush 1 Usb 1 Mop Pads 1 User Manual Only The Above Package Content, Other Products Are Not Included. Note: Light Shooting And Different Displays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cGtTs+MKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jallen Gabor","source_asin":"B091NYRJP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313432","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091NYRJP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091NYRJP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
