window.products.push({"id":313503,"name":"GRIDAL Premium Turkish Towel (Peshtemal) Hand Made, Natural & Vegan - Bath Towel & Beach Towel - 100% Cotton - Large: 37\"x70\" - Herringbone Pattern (T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B8WFymulL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<b>SPECIFICATIONS:</b> ✔Dimensions:37\"x70\" ✔Weight:14 oz. (400 gr.) ✔Material: 100% Turkish Cotton ✔Made in: Turkey ✔Produced by: GRIDAL Inc. ✔Warranty: 1 year ✔Imported from: Turkey ✔Model: Diamond ✔Pattern: Herringbone <b>WHY TO USE:</b> GRIDAL Turkish Towel brings the ancient traditional loom to modern world in a stylish way. Due to usage of long threads of high quality Turkish cotton, Turkish towel is highly absorbent and it dries quickly. Thus, it doesn’t get moldy. It takes up little space in you bag and is easy to carry around with you. It is resistant to cold-warm washing and becomes softer after a few washes. The cotton fibers are naturally dyed and do not contain any chemicals. <b>HOW TO USE:</b> Turkish Towels have been used for various purposes throughout the history in Anatolia since dark ages. They are still used in modern age as a stylish, multi-functional garment. You can use them as a bath towel, beach towel, sarong, throw, shawl, foulard, scarf, picnic blanket, camping blanket, stroller cover, and more. They can be whatever you want. <b>WHERE TO USE:</b> Due to their durability and style, Turkish Towels are being used in many commercial industries. Apart from residential and personal usage, they are preferred in hotels, public baths and spas, senior housings, beaches, saunas, gyms, beauty centers, and hair dressers. They are especially preferred in hospitality industry due to their resistance to frequent washing. <b>SUSTAINABLE USAGE:</b> GRIDAL Turkish towels are made of 100% natural material and requires minimum water and detergent to wash. No tumble dry is needed, line dry is adequate. No ironing is required but low temperature ironing can be applied at need. Optimal washing temperature is 30°C (86°F). Do not use bleach. Please feel free to contact us if you have any complaints or refund/replacement requests.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B8WFymulL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRIDAL","source_asin":"B0952W1KVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0952W1KVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0952W1KVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
