window.products.push({"id":313619,"name":"1000W 5-SPEED LCD Screen Centrifugal Juicer Machines Vegetable and Fruit, Regenerate Juice Maker with Big Adjustable 3\" Big Mouth, Anti-drip Compact J","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713igwZ+VrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Centrifugal Extraction System】1000W turbo motor with food grade sharp blades squeeze more than 30% juice, 40% vitamins and minerals in seconds. Juice yield of power juicer exactor up to 85%. Mesh filter ensures nutrients from all parts of fruits and vegetables get into juice while minimizing pulp, filtering seeds and separating foam. Zero depletion technology brings highly concentrated fresh juice and delivers cleaner output. 【5-speed Pulse Function】5 custom settings for easy maximum juice extraction from fruits and vegetables, \"1\" (8000 rpm) - \"2\" (11000 rpm) for soft foods: grapes, tomatoes, melons, citrus, cucumbers; \"3 \"(14000 rpm) - \"5\" (21000 rpm) for hard foods: apples, carrots, garlic, potatoes. Choose from 5 speeds of centrifugal juicer machine to best suit your kitchen needs. Enjoy your smooth drink with the 34oz Lid Juice Jar. 【Humanized Jucier Design】Juice extractor with 3\" wide & 8\" high feed chute holds whole fruit or vegetable without slicing or wasting more time cutting food. The design below 60dB keeps family away from the noise. Advanced digital technology and durable materials: LCD display, stainless steel construction, large pulp collector and cleaning brush to remove fibers from titanium juicing mesh. Using BPA free Tritan material. 【Convenience & Hygiene Insurance】Juicer outlet futures anti-drip design, gently lift the button, no need to worry about the splashing. Removable parts (centrifuge bowl, pulp holder, base) are dishwasher free. Making cleaning easier and faster with included brush. Made of stainless steel, anti-corrosion sharp blades and precision filter, electric juicer extracts 20% more juice, 10% more vitamins and minerals than others. 【Safety Use Guarantee】Non-slip rubber feet keep juicer machine from vibrating. Safety lock ensures safe and reliable use. If the motor overheats due to unstable power supply, improper assembly, idling, etc., the overload protection system will automatically shut down to protect motor and prolong the service life of the product. As a safe, efficient and high-quality appliance, Regenerate juicer is ETL certified.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713igwZ+VrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Regenerate","source_asin":"B09V54DZXH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V54DZXH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V54DZXH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
