window.products.push({"id":313853,"name":"Wooden Kitchen Utensils - 16.5in Long Handle Spoon and Spatula Set for Comfortable Cooking, Durable and Long-Lasting Construction","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pa7ZEDGAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The mixing spoon & shovel is refined from a whole piece of natural lithocarpus glaber , pure natural lacquer coating on the surface. The lithocarpus glaber belongs to the family of Fagaceae. It is up to several tens of meters. It grows branches all year round, and generally lives in the jungle above 1500 meters above sea level. The inner surface of the tree is reddish brown. The bark is dark brown. It is light brown after drying. It has a natural texture. There is no smell. And the tree's plasticity is very strong perfect for making tableware. The spoon and spatula made out of lithocarpus glaber is very unique. Suitable for various application scenarios. Note :Wash them with warm water and soft sponge to preserve their qualities. We recommend you dry them by hanging. If there is something sticking to our spoons, just put them in the water for 5 minutes before washing. Please store them in dry place when not used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pa7ZEDGAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duoler","source_asin":"B08QSD1DHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QSD1DHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QSD1DHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
