window.products.push({"id":313926,"name":"Joy Coffee Cup, Skinny Font, Christmas Mug, Joy, Minimalist, Joy Mug, Holiday Coffee Cup, Customizable, One Word Mugs, Ceramic, Ceramic Novelty Coffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ict28BtBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Joy Coffee Cup, Skinny Font, Christmas Mug, Joy, Minimalist, Joy Mug, Holiday Coffee Cup, Customizable, One Word Mugs, High Quality Ceramic, Ceramic Novelty Coffee Mugs 11oz, 15oz Mug, Tea Cup, Gift Present Mug For Birthday, Christmas Thanksgiving Festival ✔ What would this funny mug make a unique gift for?What better way to express your thoughts to your loved ones than gifting them with this beautifully crafted piece of art. Our Joy Coffee Cup, Skinny Font, Christmas Mug, Joy, Minimalist, Joy Mug, Holiday Coffee Cup, Customizable, One Word Mugs, High Quality Ceramic are thoughtful, funny, humorous, lovable and an affordable gift for any occasion. The new ceramic coffee mug displays Have You Tried Turning It Off on both sides so you can together have a laugh over your coffee or tea with the one you care.✔ THE LANGUAGE OF SARCASM: novelty coffee mugs will allow you to share your sense of humor and personality with the world. As you have your favorite morning beverage, along with it comes the joke of the day. In the afternoons, have a more relaxing drink of your preference. Whether it be your home or the office, you can use it for yourself or as a special gift for colleagues, members of your family or for your friends. A plethora of jokes is literally in the palm of your hands.✔ Product introduction: 1 Joy Coffee Cup, Skinny Font, Christmas Mug, Joy, Minimalist, Joy Mug, Holiday Coffee Cup, Customizable, One Word Mugs, High Quality Ceramic with gift box 1 Joy Coffee Cup, Skinny Font, Christmas Mug, Joy, Minimalist, Joy Mug, Holiday Coffee Cup, Customizable, One Word Mugs, High Quality Ceramic with gift box Design is on both sides of the cup Design is on both sides of the cup Dishwasher and microwave safe Dishwasher and microwave safe Great for hot or cold drinks Great for hot or cold drinks Comfortable, rounded handle Comfortable, rounded handle 11-ounce capacity 11-ounce capacity Color: As picture Color: As picture A reusable Coffee Cup can be used for coffee, tea, or any liquidIndividually packaged in a nice white gift box with colored tissue paper and ready to be gifted","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ict28BtBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N?A","source_asin":"B095X74TKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095X74TKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095X74TKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":313927,"name":"Wide Mouth Cuppow Item # CPWU5-001","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DfLflSChL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","description":"This is CUPPOW - our solution for easier drinking from a canning jar. The canning jar already makes an awesome platform for a travel mug: it’s easy to clean, made of heat-resistant glass, cheap, durable, and when sealed it doesn’t leak. The only problem is that with their large openings, canning jars are not great for spill-free sipping while on the move. So we adapted it - made new lids that lets us drink like a boss from virtually any wide or regular mouth canning jar. It’s a simple eco-friendly alternative to poor-performing and messy disposable hot cups, and over-built and expensive travel mugs. We’re proud to have developed a product that we look forward to using every day. That means it works great, it’s super durable, it’s made in the USA, it’s phthalate and BPA free, it’s recyclable, and it doesn’t break the bank. We hope you like it! If you do, please tell your friends! Love, Joshua and Aaron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DfLflSChL._AC_SL1127_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuppow","source_asin":"B00DIAKYF0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DIAKYF0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DIAKYF0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
