window.products.push({"id":313952,"name":"Slow Cooker, HOUSNAT 10 in 1 Programmable Cooker, 6Qt Stainless Steel, Rice Cooker, Yogurt Maker, Delay Start, Steaming Rack and Glass Lid, Adjustable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KgH1aFJfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️VERSATILE COOKING FUNCTIONS - The HOUSNAT multi-cooker contains the functions of 10 kitchen appliances. With 10 preset programs including low and high slow cook setting, sear/sauté, roast, bake, steam, stew, rice, multigrain, sous vide, and yogurt, this multi-use slow cooker offers time and energy-saving options to prepare a variety of meals with ease. Save space and money with this all-in-one cookware. ✔️CUSTOMIZABLE COOKING - Take control of your cooking with the ability to adjust cooking time and temperature to your preferences. The 24-hour \"delay start\" feature allows you to set the cooking start time, and the automatic keep-warm function keeps your dishes warm until it's time to serve. The real-time display of the remaining cooking time and selected temperature makes cooking easier and more enjoyable. ✔️1400W High Power & Triple Fusion Heat Technology - Cook up to 30% faster* than conventional ovens by combining bottom, side, and steam heat. More heat, more possibilities. The 1400W high power improves cooking efficiency, letting you enjoy food faster. The triple fusion heat technology combines three different heating elements for even cooking. ✔️SAFE AND DURABLE & EASY TO CLEAN AND DISHWASHER SAFE - The HOUSNAT slow cooker is made with thick 304 stainless steel inner pot and cool-touch handles, designed to protect your hands from burns and ensure safe transport. The tempered glass lid can withstand high temperatures and long-term use. The mirror stainless steel construction and removable pot and glass lid make cleaning a breeze. Simply place them in the dishwasher with warm soapy water after use. ✔️6QT LARGE CAPACITY PERFECT FOR ENTERTAINING - Entertain with ease using the HOUSNAT slow cooker, equipped with a generous 6-quart capacity perfect for feeding the whole family and ensuring plenty of leftovers. The ideal size for a family slow cooker is between 4-6 quarts, and the HOUSNAT slow cooker hits the sweet spot. Whether you're hosting a dinner party or cooking for your loved ones, the HOUSNAT slow cooker has got you covered with its large capacity and reliable cooking performance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KgH1aFJfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUSNAT","source_asin":"B09J95V2DG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J95V2DG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J95V2DG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
