window.products.push({"id":313959,"name":"Inflatable Wine Bottle Protector Bag, 50 Pack Wine Travel Bags w/Air Pump, Air Column Cushion Packaging Bag Wine for Shipping Travel Luggage Suitcase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ItGVGBOiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wine Bags protectors for Travel: Are you a wine lover who enjoys bringing back a souvenir or two? Or a business traveler who likes to bring back a gift for a spouse, partner, or colleague? This is the perfect wine travel bags to help you transport them. Wine bottle travel protectors increase the likelihood that the wine bottle you place in checked luggage will make it home safely and not spill all over the contents of your luggage. This wine bottle bags is designed to protect wine bottles placed inside checked luggage. These wine bottle protector sleeves are great for when you want to transport one or two bottles of wine in your luggage. Wine bags keep wine bottles (and other bottles like craft beer bombers, artisanal vinegar, olive oils) from breaking during rough luggage handling by providing some padding/protection for the wine bottle. They also help protect your packed items and the bottle’s label. Multi Protections: 1. Protecting wine bottles from breaking during air, cruise, and car travel. 2. Protecting wine labels from getting scuffed or marked up in a suitcase. 3.Protecting other packed items from stains in case the wine bottle does break or the bottle closure (e.g. cork or screw-cap) is compromised while flying. The Wine Travel Bag is a lightweight yet sturdy, designed to hold standard 750 mL sized bottles of wine, liquor and other liquids. Specification: Material: PE/PA.Color: Clear Transparent. 14-Column Wine Travel Bag Size: 7 Columns Front and 7 Columns Back. 15.4 * 9.5 inch when deflated.13.7 inch Height and 3 inch in Diameter when inflated. What do you get? 50pcs Wine Bags protectors(15.4 * 9.5 inch ). 1 * Air Pump (Random Color).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ItGVGBOiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZRuztuo","source_asin":"B091YW6YPP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091YW6YPP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091YW6YPP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
