window.products.push({"id":313966,"name":"CozyLux King Seersucker Comforter Set with Sheets Black Bed in a Bag 7-Pieces All Season Bedding Sets with Comforter, Pillow Sham, Flat Sheet, Fitted ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H3XXXzaTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The complete set utilizes 100% Microfiber. Whole-piece microfiber fill in the comforter provides exceptional warmth and cozy. The front side just has the “wrinkled look” and the underside is smooth. Solid stitching for the comforter largely improves its durability, well-preventing bunching and creates a lightweight quilt for year-round comforts. Elaborate Design: The elastic deep pocket fitted sheet fits mattress max up to 16\" deep. That can always keep non-slip no matter how you twist and turn in your bed. Soft Black tones add a touch of color to this elegantly simplified look What You Can Get: King Size 7-Piece seersucker bed in a bag includes - 1x Comforter(102\" * 90\") + 2x Pillow shams( 20\" * 36\")+ 2x Pillow cases( 20\" * 40\")+ 1x Flat sheet(108\" * 102\")+ 1x Fitted sheet(78\" * 80\") - Our bed in a bag is packaged in a vacuum bag, so you can dry it in low heat or tap the comforter gently while baking it in the sun to fluffy again. Easy Care: The bedding sets are machine washable which can save you more time and energy. For year round softness and prevent pilling up, it's highly recommend to wash it in the gentle cycle with cold water, sun-dry or tumble dry in low when needed. Let our comforter sheets keep providing you and your family with cozy sleeping Satisfactory Service and Reminder: The product color may look vastly different under different lighting conditions. As your satisfaction is of the utmost importance to us. Cozylux is committed to offering you premium products and a caring service. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions about our products. We would try our best to solve problems as soon as possible","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H3XXXzaTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CozyLux","source_asin":"B08CR45PGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-313966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CR45PGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CR45PGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
